{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:378b4a7c10892355","name":"Slicer Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-378b4a7c10892355","title":"Slicer Talent Tree","revision":18503,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:13:27Z","sha256":"dee68b90344297bef586d8c7f2f6c71125cb8bcb87dc4408d783e2d5e8c6bd96","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18503","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Slicer%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-378b4a7c10892355","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You move like a ghost through the HoloNet, and can hack into enemy mainframes and computer systems with astonishing grace.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Gimmick"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can ",{"tag":"a","children":["Issue Routine Command"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Issue_Routine_Command"}," to a computer as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Master Slicer"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite: "]},{"tag":"b","children":["Gimmick"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You may choose to reroll any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check made to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Improve Access"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Improve_Access"}," on a computer, keeping the better of the two results.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Trace"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can substitute your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," skill for any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gather Information"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gather_Information","referenceId":"reference:a719fb58321fb08c"}," check as long as you have access to a computer network.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Additional Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Electronic Forgery"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can use your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," modifier in place of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," modifier to create a deceptive appearance with forged electronic documents.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Electronic Sabotage"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You excel at causing havoc with computers and electronics. As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you can lock down a computer terminal by making a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check, making it potentially difficult for anyone else to access. That computer is considered Unfriendly to anyone other than you who attempts to use it, and the result of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check replaces the computer's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," on an attempt to change its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attitude"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"},". This effect ends if anyone else succeeds in adjusting the computer's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attitude"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," to Indifferent. You cannot ",{"tag":"a","children":["Take 20"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Take_20"}," on this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Security Slicer"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are an expert in electronic security. When you make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disable Device"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disable_Device"},", you can do so without the help of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Security Kit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Security_Kit","referenceId":"reference:b3de8e74a439451f"},". Additionally, something goes wrong only when you fail the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check by 10 or more.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Virus"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites: "]},{"tag":"b","children":["Electronic Sabotage"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can substitute a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check for a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check when disabling a computerized device. The effort takes 1 minute and the DC is equal to the computer's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},". In addition, whenever anyone accesses the afflicted computer using a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," or another computer, that computer or Droid's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attitude"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," immediately becomes Unfriendly.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
